{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103350","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710335001:1":{"text":"ロワン様を見てると、こっちまで辛くなってくるわ……","source_cn":"看着罗万少爷这样子，心里真不好受啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ED35630757C8F9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710335002:1":{"text":"ロワン様がどうかしたのか？いつもと変わらないように見えるけど……","source_cn":"罗万少爷怎么了？我没看出有什么变化啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAC24856FEED03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710335003:1":{"text":"どうしたか、ですって？商会にまで古聖堂が消えたっていう通達が来てるのよ。","source_cn":"商会的人都接到了协查圣古堂消失的通知，这还叫没什么事啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF47318DF06B14855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710335004:1":{"text":"王室の手前、落ち込んでるように見せてるだけじゃないのか？","source_cn":"呃……这是做给王室看的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643B35766B5F6FEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710335005:1":{"text":"そんなわけないでしょう！明らかに心ここにあらずだし、ため息だって、いつもより十倍は多いのよ！","source_cn":"怎么可能！罗万少爷分明很上心，他今天叹气的次数比往常的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x148FB0504400B045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl